Tree
Path	Kind	Holds	Register
.	folder	the whole: MTSV applied to the eight universal text sets	Architecture › Containment
README.md	file	what it is, how to install and use it, where to get help	Project › Documentation › README; root README Help section
LICENSE	file	the MIT licence text	Project › Licensing › LICENSE
SECURITY.md	file	how to report a vulnerability	Project › Documentation › SECURITY
.gitattributes	file	line endings of .mtsv, .json and .jsonl	Project › Repository › .gitattributes
.gitignore	file	the entries	Project › Repository › .gitignore
WORKING-RECORD.mtsv	file	this record	
spec/	folder	stating the properties: one section per Integrations artefact	Architecture › Concerns; Project › Repository › mtsv top-level layout
conformance/	folder	checking the properties; no language, no provider	Project › Repository › mtsv top-level layout
conformance/README.md	file	how the cases are laid out	Content › Conformance
conformance/<artefact>/	folder	one per Integrations artefact; each case a .jsonl input and its expected .mtsv	Content › Integrations
conformance/providers/<provider>/	folder	one per provider: its input and the same universal .mtsv	Architecture › Extension › a new integration
python/	folder	the Python implementation	Architecture › Extension › a new language folder
python/pyproject.toml	file	build, metadata, versions; depends on mtsv	Project › Build; Metadata; Versioning
python/MANIFEST.in	file	files in the sdist	Project › Build › MANIFEST.in
python/README.md	file	install, use, and the Layout section: the module guide	Architecture › Map; Project › Documentation
python/src/living_memory/	folder	the package, src layout	Project › Build › python/src
python/src/living_memory/py.typed	file	marks a typed package	Code › Definitions › py.typed
python/src/living_memory/relations.py	file	level 1: how a value becomes keyed sheets: normalization, positions, values of any shape, numbers as written	Architecture › Parts
