python/src/living_memory/system_instructions.py	file	level 3: the system instructions schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/tool_definitions.py	file	level 3: the tool definitions schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/input_messages.py	file	level 3: the input messages schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/output_messages.py	file	level 3: the output messages schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/tool_call_arguments.py	file	level 3: the tool call arguments schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/tool_call_result.py	file	level 3: the tool call result schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/memory_records.py	file	level 3: the memory records schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/retrieval_documents.py	file	level 3: the retrieval documents schema	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/integrations/__init__.py	file	level 4: which reader reads which input	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/integrations/otlp_json.py	file	level 4: how an OTLP JSON Lines file is read, and where the eight are on its spans and events	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/integrations/providers/__init__.py	file	level 4: which provider formats exist	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/_command.py	file	level 5: how a person runs a conversion	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/__main__.py	file	level 5: the command's entry point	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/__init__.py	file	the public interface	Architecture › Parts
python/src/living_memory/integrations/providers/<provider>.py	file	one per provider format	Architecture › Extension › a new integration
