Modules
Module	Level	Secret	Uses	Integrations artefacts
relations	1	how a value becomes keyed sheets: normalization, positions, values of any shape, numbers as written	mtsv	relations; nonsimple values; order; numbers; sheet and column names
parts	2	the message part types, shared by the schemas that repeat them	relations	GenAI structured attributes
system_instructions	3	the system instructions schema	parts; relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI system instructions
tool_definitions	3	the tool definitions schema	relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI tool definitions
input_messages	3	the input messages schema	parts; relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI input messages
output_messages	3	the output messages schema	parts; relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI output messages
tool_call_arguments	3	the tool call arguments schema	relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI tool call arguments
tool_call_result	3	the tool call result schema	relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI tool call result
memory_records	3	the memory records schema	relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI memory records
retrieval_documents	3	the retrieval documents schema	relations	GenAI structured attributes; GenAI retrieval documents
integrations/__init__	4	which reader reads which input	integrations/otlp_json; integrations/providers/__init__	
integrations/otlp_json	4	how an OTLP JSON Lines file is read, and where the eight are on its spans and events	level 3	OTLP file; OTLP JSON; OTLP records; OTLP attributes; GenAI structured attributes
integrations/providers/__init__	4	which provider formats exist	level 3	
_command	5	how a person runs a conversion	integrations/__init__	Interfaces
__main__	5	the command's entry point	_command	Interfaces
__init__		the public interface	integrations/__init__	Interfaces
