Item	What is undecided	Where
key and position names	the column names above for position, node and parent node	Integrations › sheet and column names
text holding HT, LF, FF or CR	atomic to Codd, out of scope in the MTSV draft: to settle at the MTSV level	Integrations › text values
log records without ids	their key is their position in the file	Integrations › relations
numbers as written	kept as the source writes them, by analogy	Integrations › numbers
properties beyond a schema	each goes to its object's value sheet	Integrations › nonsimple values
