conformance case layout	file names; whether cases also exist that must be refused	Tree
.jsonl line endings	the .gitattributes row names .mtsv and .json only	Tree
library interface	the call names, following the Interfaces rows	Modules
command	its name and options, following the Interfaces rows	Modules
this record	its name, and no register row places it	Tree
